  "name": "return_regret_hybrid",
  "intent": "Augment the parent return-aware nearest-neighbor with a regret term to escape local optima, especially hurting uniform random instances where greedy gets trapped in poor configurations. The regret term penalizes candidates whose neighbors would have very limited alternatives, biasing toward 'bridge' picks that connect sparse regions. Small return weight retained for tour closure.",
